### 5. late-throw2.cjs: 'data' listener that throws (handled) on chunks read ahead of it
A) 5 chunks then exit; listener attached in 'exit'; throws on all
  bun-base  exit attach data:12345 U end close:0
  bun-arm   exit attach data:1 U data:2 U
  node      exit attach data:1 U
C) same; throws on the first 2
  bun-base  exit attach data:12345 U end close:0
  bun-arm   exit attach data:1 U data:2 U
  node      exit attach data:1 U
D) 4 chunks, attach at 300 ms while the child runs, 2 more chunks, exit; throws on all
  bun-base  attach data:1234 U data:5 unhandledRejection exit
  bun-arm   attach data:1 U data:2 U data:3 U data:4 U exit
  node      attach data:1 U data:2 U data:3 U exit
A on stdio[3]
  bun-base  exit attach close:0 data:1 U
  bun-arm   exit attach close:0 data:1 U
  node      exit attach data:1 U
pause-throw.cjs (pause, 5 chunks pile up, resume; throws on all)
  bun-base  resume data:1 U data:2 U data:3 U exit
  bun-arm   resume data:1 U data:2 U data:3 U exit
  node      resume data:1 U data:2 U data:3 U exit

